        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;height:100%;width:100%;overflow:auto;box-sizing:border-box;background:#0f152a;color:#f5f0ff;font-family:system-ui\"><main style=\"max-width:980px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(22px,5cqw,54px)\"><div style=\"border-top:3px solid #e4c783;padding-top:14px;font:800 12px system-ui;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#e4c783\">THE TWILITE ZONE / THE GALLERY</div><h1 style=\"font:600 clamp(44px,10cqw,88px)/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:34px 0 22px\">Come see<br><span style=\"color:#c7b7ff\">what a graph can be.</span></h1><p style=\"font:400 clamp(18px,2.5cqw,24px)/1.5 system-ui;color:#cbd5e6;max-width:760px\">This isn't a catalog of ideas. These are live graph artifacts. Open a door, look around, and inspect how each one works.</p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:18px;margin:34px 0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #4b526b;border-radius:17px;background:#1d2540;padding:24px;min-width:0\"><div style=\"color:#b8e7d1;font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.17em\">EXHIBIT 01 / WORK</div><h2 style=\"font:600 30px/1.07 Georgia,serif;margin:13px 0;color:#f7f3ff\">The Task Studio</h2><p style=\"font:600 16px/1.4 system-ui;color:#dcd5ff;margin:10px 0\">A plan that knows its own status.</p><p style=\"font:400 15px/1.55 system-ui;color:#c5cddd\">See a task graph with a goal, work items, questions and views derived from its structure.</p><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/task-template-demo/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;color:#f6dc98;font:700 14px system-ui;text-decoration:underline;margin-top:14px\">Enter exhibit →</a></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #4b526b;border-radius:17px;background:#1d2540;padding:24px;min-width:0\"><div style=\"color:#f5ca92;font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.17em\">EXHIBIT 02 / PROJECTS</div><h2 style=\"font:600 30px/1.07 Georgia,serif;margin:13px 0;color:#f7f3ff\">The Twilite Project</h2><p style=\"font:600 16px/1.4 system-ui;color:#dcd5ff;margin:10px 0\">A project as a place to work.</p><p style=\"font:400 15px/1.55 system-ui;color:#c5cddd\">Enter a project workspace connecting the product, news, release notes and its working room.</p><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/projects/twilite/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;color:#f6dc98;font:700 14px system-ui;text-decoration:underline;margin-top:14px\">Enter exhibit →</a></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #4b526b;border-radius:17px;background:#1d2540;padding:24px;min-width:0\"><div style=\"color:#c9b6fa;font:800 11px system-ui;letter-spacing:.17em\">EXHIBIT 03 / PLACES</div><h2 style=\"font:600 30px/1.07 Georgia,serif;margin:13px 0;color:#f7f3ff\">Company Headquarters</h2><p style=\"font:600 16px/1.4 system-ui;color:#dcd5ff;margin:10px 0\">A graph you can walk into.</p><p style=\"font:400 15px/1.55 system-ui;color:#c5cddd\">Visit Twilite LLC&#39;s public presentation with a spatial headquarters environment and structured content.</p><a href=\"github://mikemartinez1974/public/company/root.node\" style=\"display:inline-block;color:#f6dc98;font:700 14px system-ui;text-decoration:underline;margin-top:14px\">Enter exhibit →</a></div></div><p style=\"font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#aab6d0\">Every exhibit opens a real graph. You can inspect the nodes behind its presentation and follow its links onward.</p><nav style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;margin:35px 0\"><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/boulevard/root.node\" style=\"color:#e4c783\">← The Boulevard</a><a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/root.node\" style=\"color:#e4c783\">Twilite Zone entrance</a></nav></main></div>"
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": ""
      }
    },
